# ChaiScript: ChaiScript language reference (chaiscript.com); requirements/languages/chaiscript.md
name     chaiscript chai
keyword  def var auto class attr if else while for break continue return try catch finally global
keyword  fun this
builtin  true false print puts size
line-comment   //
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes interp=dollar
string   ' '  : escapes
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.
calls
